@@ -0,0 +1,699 @@
+# 3D Runner Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Build a minimalist 3D endless runner mini-game with jump/lanes controls, procedural obstacles, and score tracking.
+
+**Architecture:** Vite + Vanilla JS + Three.js. World moves in -Z direction while player stays stationary. Simple AABB collision detection. localStorage for high scores.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Vite, Three.js, CSS3
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- Bundle size < 100kb
+- 60 FPS desktop / 30 FPS mobile target
+- No shadows (performance)
+- 3 lanes: positions -3, 0, 3
+- Lane width: 3 units
+- Jump force: 15 units/sec
+- Gravity: 30 units²
+- Player: blue cube (#3498db)
+- Obstacle: red prism (#e74c3c)
+- Score: 1 point per 10 units traveled
+
+---
+
+### Task 1: Project Setup & Basic Scene
+
+**Files:**
+- Create: `index.html`
+- Create: `style.css`
+- Create: `vite.config.js`
+- Create: `package.json`
+- Create: `src/main.js`
+- Create: `src/scene.js`
+
+**Interfaces:**
+- Produces: `initScene()` function that returns Three.js scene/camera/renderer
+
+- [ ] **Step 1: Write package.json**
+```json
+{
+  "name": "3d-runner",
+  "version": "0.1.0",
+  "type": "module",
+  "scripts": {
+    "dev": "vite",
+    "build": "vite build"
+  },
+  "dependencies": {
+    "three": "^0.160.0"
+  },
+  "devDependencies": {
+    "vite": "^5.0.0"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+- [ ] **Step 2: Write vite.config.js**
+```javascript
+export default {
+  build: {
+    target: 'esnext',
+    minify: 'terser',
+    rollupOptions: {
+      output: {
+        manualChunks: {
+          three: ['three']
+        }
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+- [ ] **Step 3: Write index.html**
+```html
+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html>
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>3D Runner</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <div id="canvas-container"></div>
+  <div id="ui-layer">
+    <div id="start-screen">
+      <h1>3D Runner</h1>
+      <p>Tap or Space to start</p>
+    </div>
+    <div id="hud" style="display: none;">
+      <div id="score">Score: 0</div>
+      <div id="high-score">Best: 0</div>
+    </div>
+    <div id="game-over" style="display: none;">
+      <h2>Game Over</h2>
+      <p>Final Score: <span id="final-score">0</span></p>
+      <p>Best: <span id="best-score">0</span></p>
+      <button id="restart-btn">Play Again</button>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+  <script type="module" src="src/main.js"></script>
+</body>
+</html>
+```
